{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>ראו</b> Four times in the Masorah, and two are written with vav and two with heh: ראו ראינו · וראו ראו · ראה ראיתי · אם ראה תראה בעני אמתך. And one: שבתי וראה תחת השמש. Those that speak of the plural, like ראו ראינו and וראו ראו, are written with vav, and those that speak of the singular are written with heh, for sometimes it is read as ראה, which is singular."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:05.236713303Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}